Import Elastic Security detection rules (needs tenant credentials).

␛[1m␛[4mUsage:␛[0m ␛[1mopentide generate extract elastic␛[0m [OPTIONS]

␛[1m␛[4mOptions:␛[0m
      ␛[1m--space␛[0m <SPACE>
          Kibana space ID
          
          [default: default]

      ␛[1m--include-prebuilt, --custom-only␛[0m
          Include prebuilt rules converted to custom rules with derived UUIDs
          
          [default: custom-only]

      ␛[1m--help␛[0m
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide generate extract elastic --space default

